@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

participant "User Trigger\n(HotKey / Menu / CLI / Watcher)" as User
participant "CascadeEngine" as Engine
participant "Sorting Phase\n(MRU / Alpha / Custom)" as Sorter
participant "WindowLayoutGeometry\n(Quad-Edge Engine)" as Geometry
participant "macOS WindowServer" as WS

== 1. Sequence Ordering (Orthogonal) ==
User -> Engine: Request Layout (OrderMode, LayoutStyleQuadEdge)
Engine -> Sorter: Sort active windows
Sorter --> Engine: Ordered sequence [W0, W1, W2, W3, ...]

== 2. Quad-Edge Geometric Calculation ==
Engine -> Geometry: assignQuadEdgeFramesToOrderedWindows:onUsableFrame:delta:
activate Geometry

group Clockwise Edge Partitioning
    Geometry -> Geometry: Window 0 (i=0, side=Top):    Frame = (δ, 0, W-2δ, H-δ)\n-> Unoccluded Top Bar [x ∈ (δ, W-δ), y ∈ (0, δ)]
    Geometry -> Geometry: Window 1 (i=1, side=Right):  Frame = (δ, δ, W-δ, H-2δ)\n-> Unoccluded Right Bar [x ∈ (W-δ, W), y ∈ (δ, H-δ)]
    Geometry -> Geometry: Window 2 (i=2, side=Bottom): Frame = (δ, δ, W-2δ, H-δ)\n-> Unoccluded Bottom Bar [x ∈ (δ, W-δ), y ∈ (H-δ, H)]
    Geometry -> Geometry: Window 3 (i=3, side=Left):   Frame = (0, δ, W-δ, H-2δ)\n-> Unoccluded Left Bar [x ∈ (0, δ), y ∈ (δ, H-δ)]
    opt Window count > 4 (Multi-Cycle)
        Geometry -> Geometry: Cycles c = i / 4 offset inward by c * δ\nGuarantees all N windows have disjoint clickable bars
    end
end

Geometry --> Engine: Target frames calculated (94%+ screen area per window)
deactivate Geometry

== 3. Multi-Phase Accessibility Dispatch ==
Engine -> WS: Pre-flight move, size dispatch, boundary clamp
note over WS: Every window exposes a full-length clickable bar\non its perimeter edge (Top, Right, Bottom, Left).\nAny window brought forward leaves all other bars 100% clickable.

@enduml
